                [
                  "Can I wait while you work?",
                  "For short jobs such as tyres, an oil change or a diagnosis, many people wait. For a longer repair, leave the car and we call you when it is ready."
                ],
                [
                  "What should I tell you when I book?",
                  "The make, model and year, what you noticed (a noise, a light, a smell) and when it happens. A photo or short video of the dashboard helps a lot."
